parameters.description:
Specify the policies you want to update in the specified key vault. For Example, {
            "accessPolicies": [
                {
                    "tenantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
                    "objectId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
                    "permissions": {
                        "keys": [
                            "encrypt"
                        ],
                        "secrets": [
                            "get"
                        ],
                        "certificates": [
                            "get"
                        ]
                    }
                }
            ]
        }

